From d10f8dbf10b0f494735b1067abdb3549401af21a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: author <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 15:18:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] KQ1: q8_0 K lane for 35B decode + GEMM prefill

- fattn-maxwell-gemm: dequantise q8_0 K in convert_kv; guard allows K F16 or Q8_0; kq8 counter.
- fattn-occamy: staged q8 decode kernel (per-warp double-buffered smem K staging),
  opt-in GGML_CUDA_OCCAMY_KVQ8_STAGE=1 (needs KVQ8=1); occamy_kq1 counters at exit.
- fattn.cu: count stock fallback with q8 K.
- test-backend-ops: q8-K eval cases at 35B geometry; decode perf micro F16 vs Q8 K at 24K/48K/96K.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/fattn-maxwell-gemm.cuh | 26 +++++--
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/fattn-occamy.cu        | 94 ++++++++++++++++++++++-
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/fattn-occamy.cuh       |  1 +
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/fattn.cu               |  3 +
 tests/test-backend-ops.cpp                | 24 ++++++
 5 files changed, 139 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

